    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">A gyf he gesohte leodbiscop oððe ealdorman oððon healicne heafodstede, þonne ahte he VII nihta grið, butan man leng geunnan wolde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he appealed to a suffragan bishop or an ealdorman or an important capital city, then he had sanctuary for seven nights, unless he was granted more.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 gyf he gesohte leodbiscop oððe ealdorman oððon healicne heafodstede, þonne ahte he VII nihta grið, butan man leng geunnan wolde.</ab>
      </div>
